From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerard Marull-Paretas <gerard@teslabs.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:42:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: panel: orisetech,otm8009a: Allow
 rotation

Boards may mount the panel rotated. Allow the common rotation property
of panels.

PebbleOS describes the panel of the STM32H747I-DISCO with it.
---
 display/panel/orisetech,otm8009a.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/display/panel/orisetech,otm8009a.yaml b/display/panel/orisetech,otm8009a.yaml
index 1f697da..1ec63b2 100644
--- a/display/panel/orisetech,otm8009a.yaml
+++ b/display/panel/orisetech,otm8009a.yaml
@@ -31,6 +31,8 @@ properties:
   reset-gpios:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  rotation: true
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
